      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Leadership Roles and Connections: Amy and Josh have substantial connections and spheres of influence in the philanthropic sector. Beginning in June of 2022, Josh will take on the role as chair of the Giving USA Foundation. Amy just completed her tenure as the 2021 president of AFP&apos;s Greater Houston Chapter, one of the largest chapters in the association. Integration Into Speaking: Josh and Amy are both frequent speakers at industry conferences and events as are a number of other BWF staffers/consultants. Events include conferences such as CASE Summit, TLCC2022 (Tessitura Network), AFP , ICON 2022 in Las Vegas, LEAD 2022 in Houston, BWF VP Conference 2023, AFP-GHC Ask The Experts Houston 2022, AHP (Association of Healthcare Professionals), AASP (Association of Advancement Services Professionals). They will include books as part of their speaking fee when possible, while BWF staffers will promote during their speaking engagements&quot;--</marc:subfield>
